  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 302.48 Significant corrosion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 302.48 “Significant corrosion” means corrosion evidenced by a shedding or leafing product or scaling, or by pitting corrosion, regardless of whether the corrosion is progressing at the time of discovery.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 300) #10487, eff 2-7-14; ss by #14094, eff 10-4-24 (formerly Env-Or 302.47)",
